  "prefLabel": "Tax 209.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 209.01 Applicability. This part, as well as Tax 201, shall apply to all appeals of the department of revenue administration (DRA) decisions under RSA 21-J:9-a, V; RSA 21-J:14-g; RSA 21-J:28-b, IV; RSA 77-B:22; RSA 78:31-a; RSA 82:16-a; RSA 83-F:8; RSA 162-A; RSA 162-I; and RSA 198:60.\n\nSource. #5638, eff 9-1-93; ss by #6762, eff 7-1-98; ss by #7153, eff 12-10-99; ss by #7874-B, eff 4-18-03; ss by #8987-A, eff 9-24-07; ss by #9538, eff 9-8-09; ss by #10625-B, eff 6-26-14; ss by #13711-B, eff 8-2-23",
